<Layouts.marketing flash={@flash} current_scope={@current_scope} page_title={@page_title}>
  <%!-- ───────────── HERO ───────────── --%>
  <section class="bg-base-200 border-b border-base-300">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 lg:py-24 grid lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_1fr] gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <div>
        <.eyebrow name="how it works" />
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.05] mt-4">
          How one person runs a <span class="text-primary">whole software company.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-base-content/70 mt-6 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
          CodeMySpec builds your software, runs it, and grows it. You bring the idea and the
          judgment; the machine does the labor. Here's what each part actually does for your business.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
          <.link href={~p"/users/register"} class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Start free</.link>
          <a href="#build" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">See the three parts</a>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-base-content/60">
          You steer · <span class="font-semibold text-base-content">it does the heavy lifting</span>. Not automation — leverage.
        </p>
      </div>

      <%!-- Hero media: the operator's business, running --%>
      <div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-xl order-first lg:order-none">
        <div class="px-5 py-4 border-b border-base-300 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="font-semibold">Your business, running</span>
          <span class="badge badge-success badge-sm gap-1 ml-auto">
            <span class="inline-block w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-current"></span> Live
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-box bg-base-200 p-3">
            <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm shrink-0">Build</span>
            <span class="text-sm">Your app is live at <span class="font-medium">marlasbakery.com</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-box bg-base-200 p-3">
            <span class="badge badge-secondary badge-sm shrink-0">Operate</span>
            <span class="text-sm">Dana: "Custom cake for 40?" — 2 new in your inbox</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-box bg-base-200 p-3">
            <span class="badge badge-accent badge-sm shrink-0">Grow</span>
            <span class="text-sm">+18 new customers from your ads this month</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%!-- ───────────── THE MODEL ───────────── --%>
  <section class="border-b border-base-300">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 lg:py-20 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-snug">
        A software company has three jobs. <span class="text-primary">You and the model do all three.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-base-content/70 mt-5 leading-relaxed">
        Building the software, keeping it running, and finding people to sell it to used to mean
        hiring engineers, support, and marketers. Now it's the two of you — you make the calls,
        the machine does the work.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%!-- ───────────── BUILD ───────────── --%>
  <section id="build" class="border-b border-base-300">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.1fr] gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-start">
        <div>
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-lg">Build</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-4">Real software, not a demo.</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-base-content/70 mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            You describe what you want and shape it together with the model — page by page, feature
            by feature. What comes out is an actual application your customers log into, not a
            prototype that falls over when the tenth person shows up.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg text-base-content/70 mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            A product you sell, or a tool that runs your business — if it's software people log
            into, it fits. You stay in the driver's seat the whole way.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-6 text-sm font-semibold text-primary">Free to build — always.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body gap-2">
              <.icon name="hero-cursor-arrow-ripple" class="size-6 text-primary" />
              <h3 class="font-semibold">You describe, it builds</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">Plain language in, working software out. No coding required from you.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body gap-2">
              <.icon name="hero-users" class="size-6 text-primary" />
              <h3 class="font-semibold">Holds up under real use</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">Built to run with real customers and real data, not just a screenshot.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body gap-2">
              <.icon name="hero-adjustments-horizontal" class="size-6 text-primary" />
              <h3 class="font-semibold">You call the shots</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">You decide what it does and how it works; the model handles the labor.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body gap-2">
              <.icon name="hero-key" class="size-6 text-primary" />
              <h3 class="font-semibold">It's yours</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">You own what you build. Bring your own AI keys; we never mark them up.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%!-- ───────────── OPERATE ───────────── --%>
  <section class="border-b border-base-300 bg-base-200">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_1fr] gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 order-last lg:order-first">
          <div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body gap-2">
              <.icon name="hero-envelope" class="size-6 text-secondary" />
              <h3 class="font-semibold">Email on your domain</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">Send and receive as you@yourbusiness.com. Real threads, real history.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body gap-2">
              <.icon name="hero-chat-bubble-left-right" class="size-6 text-secondary" />
              <h3 class="font-semibold">Live chat on your site</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">Customers message you from your app; you answer from one shared inbox.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body gap-2">
              <.icon name="hero-inbox-stack" class="size-6 text-secondary" />
              <h3 class="font-semibold">One inbox for it all</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">Email and chat land in the same place, so nothing slips through.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body gap-2">
              <.icon name="hero-server-stack" class="size-6 text-secondary" />
              <h3 class="font-semibold">You never touch a server</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">It's hosted, running, and looked after. You just run your business.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <span class="badge badge-secondary badge-lg">Operate</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-4">Run it like a business.</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-base-content/70 mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Software isn't done when it's built — it has to be run. CodeMySpec gives you the pieces
            a real business needs: email on your own domain, live chat with the people using it, and
            a single inbox where all of it shows up.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg text-base-content/70 mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Whether it's a product you sell or an internal tool your team relies on, your customers
            reach a real business — and you never spin up a server or wrangle a hosting bill.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%!-- ───────────── GROW ───────────── --%>
  <section class="border-b border-base-300">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.1fr] gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-start">
        <div>
          <span class="badge badge-accent badge-lg">Grow</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-4">Find the next customer.</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-base-content/70 mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            If you're selling to the world, growth can't be a second full-time job. CodeMySpec
            publishes your content, runs your Google Ads, and shows you who's actually converting —
            so you can put your attention where it pays off.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-6 text-sm font-semibold text-accent">For when you're ready to sell to the world.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body gap-2">
              <.icon name="hero-document-text" class="size-6 text-accent" />
              <h3 class="font-semibold">Publish content</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">Get your blog, pages, and updates live without touching a CMS.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body gap-2">
              <.icon name="hero-megaphone" class="size-6 text-accent" />
              <h3 class="font-semibold">Run your ads</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">Google Ads set up and managed, pointed at the customers you want.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body gap-2">
              <.icon name="hero-chart-bar" class="size-6 text-accent" />
              <h3 class="font-semibold">See who converts</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">Know which visitors turn into customers, and which spend never pays back.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body gap-2">
              <.icon name="hero-arrow-trending-up" class="size-6 text-accent" />
              <h3 class="font-semibold">Growth, not a second job</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">The marketing work runs alongside the business instead of on top of it.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%!-- ───────────── TWO WAYS IN ───────────── --%>
  <section class="border-b border-base-300 bg-base-200">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 lg:py-24">
      <.eyebrow name="how you start" />
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-3">Do it yourself, or do it with me.</h2>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mt-12">
        <div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
          <div class="card-body">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-primary">Drive it yourself</span>
            <h3 class="card-title mt-1">Sit down and build</h3>
            <p class="text-base-content/70">Start free. Work with the model, ship the first version, own everything you make.</p>
            <div class="card-actions mt-3">
              <.link href={~p"/users/register"} class="btn btn-primary">Start free</.link>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card bg-neutral text-neutral-content shadow-lg">
          <div class="card-body">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] opacity-70">Build it with me</span>
            <h3 class="card-title mt-1">Bring the business — we build it together</h3>
            <p class="opacity-80">
              Want the result without learning the tooling? We get on a call, build the first
              version together, then hand you the keys to run it.
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-secondary mt-1">This is how most people start.</p>
            <div class="card-actions mt-3">
              <a href={ExternalLinks.cal_john()} class="btn btn-secondary">Talk to John</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%!-- ───────────── PROOF ───────────── --%>
  <section class="border-b border-base-300">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 lg:py-24">
      <.eyebrow name="proof" />
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center mt-6">
        <div>
          <blockquote class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium leading-snug tracking-tight">
            I run my whole company on it. <span class="text-primary">One person.</span>
            The app, this website, the email that reaches you from me, and the marketing that put
            this page in front of you.
          </blockquote>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mt-6">
            <div class="avatar avatar-placeholder">
              <div class="w-11 rounded-lg bg-primary text-primary-content">
                <span class="font-bold">JD</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-sm text-base-content/70">
              <span class="font-semibold text-base-content">John Davenport</span>
              — building CodeMySpec with the model, solo, in real time.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body py-4">
              <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3">
                <span class="font-semibold">MetricFlow</span>
                <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm">built in 13 days</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-base-content/60">A real app with real integrations, end to end.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body py-4">
              <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3">
                <span class="font-semibold">Fuellytics</span>
                <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm">live</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-base-content/60">A product in the hands of paying customers.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body py-4">
              <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3">
                <span class="font-semibold">This company</span>
                <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm">one person</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-base-content/60">Built, operated, and grown the same way you would.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%!-- ───────────── PRICING ───────────── --%>
  <section class="border-b border-base-300 bg-base-200">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 lg:py-24 text-center">
      <.eyebrow name="pricing" align="center" />
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.06] mt-4">
        <span class="text-primary">Free</span> to build. Pay when it's running.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-base-content/70 mt-5 leading-relaxed">
        Building your software is free, always — and we never mark up the AI that powers it. You pay
        only when you're ready to run and grow it.
      </p>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mt-12 text-left">
        <div class="card bg-base-100 border-2 border-primary shadow-sm">
          <div class="card-body">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-base-content/60">Build</span>
            <div class="text-4xl font-bold mt-1">$0 <span class="text-base font-normal text-base-content/50">/ forever</span></div>
            <p class="text-base-content/70">Build your app and see it work. Own what you make.</p>
            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
              <li class="flex gap-2"><.icon name="hero-check" class="size-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" /> Build real software with the model</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><.icon name="hero-check" class="size-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" /> Bring your own AI keys, no markup</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><.icon name="hero-check" class="size-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" /> Yours to keep — no lock-in</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="card-actions mt-4">
              <.link href={~p"/users/register"} class="btn btn-primary btn-block">Start free</.link>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
          <div class="card-body">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-base-content/60">Operate &amp; Grow</span>
            <div class="text-4xl font-bold mt-1">$100 <span class="text-base font-normal text-base-content/50">/ month</span></div>
            <p class="text-base-content/70">Everything after launch, in one place.</p>
            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
              <li class="flex gap-2"><.icon name="hero-check" class="size-4 text-secondary shrink-0 mt-0.5" /> Email on your own domain</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><.icon name="hero-check" class="size-4 text-secondary shrink-0 mt-0.5" /> Live chat + one shared inbox</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><.icon name="hero-check" class="size-4 text-secondary shrink-0 mt-0.5" /> Content publishing + Google Ads</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><.icon name="hero-check" class="size-4 text-secondary shrink-0 mt-0.5" /> See who's converting</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="card-actions mt-4">
              <a href={ExternalLinks.cal_john()} class="btn btn-outline btn-block">Build it with me</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%!-- ───────────── FAQ ───────────── --%>
  <section class="border-b border-base-300">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 lg:py-24">
      <.eyebrow name="questions" />
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-3">The questions people actually ask.</h2>

      <div class="mt-10 join join-vertical w-full">
        <div class="collapse collapse-plus join-item border border-base-300 bg-base-100">
          <input type="radio" name="faq" checked="checked" />
          <div class="collapse-title font-semibold">Do I need to know how to code?</div>
          <div class="collapse-content text-base-content/70">
            No. You describe what you want and make the calls; the model does the building. And if
            you'd rather not learn the tooling at all, we'll build the first version with you and
            hand you the keys.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="collapse collapse-plus join-item border border-base-300 bg-base-100">
          <input type="radio" name="faq" />
          <div class="collapse-title font-semibold">What can I build?</div>
          <div class="collapse-content text-base-content/70">
            A product you sell, or an internal tool that runs your business. If it's software your
            customers or your team log into, it fits.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="collapse collapse-plus join-item border border-base-300 bg-base-100">
          <input type="radio" name="faq" />
          <div class="collapse-title font-semibold">Is it really automated? Will it run itself?</div>
          <div class="collapse-content text-base-content/70">
            No — and it never will be. You steer every decision that matters; the machine does the
            labor. This is leverage, not replacement: you run the business, it does the heavy lifting.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="collapse collapse-plus join-item border border-base-300 bg-base-100">
          <input type="radio" name="faq" />
          <div class="collapse-title font-semibold">How long until I have something real?</div>
          <div class="collapse-content text-base-content/70">
            The first working version comes together fast — days, not months. MetricFlow, a real app
            with real integrations, was built end to end in 13 days.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="collapse collapse-plus join-item border border-base-300 bg-base-100">
          <input type="radio" name="faq" />
          <div class="collapse-title font-semibold">Is the app mine?</div>
          <div class="collapse-content text-base-content/70">
            Yes. You own what you build, and you bring your own AI keys — we never mark up your
            tokens or lock you in.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="collapse collapse-plus join-item border border-base-300 bg-base-100">
          <input type="radio" name="faq" />
          <div class="collapse-title font-semibold">What does the $100/month cover?</div>
          <div class="collapse-content text-base-content/70">
            Everything after launch: email on your domain, live chat and a shared inbox, content
            publishing, Google Ads, and conversion tracking. Building is always free.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%!-- ───────────── FINAL CTA ───────────── --%>
  <section class="bg-base-200">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 lg:py-28 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        You've had the idea long enough.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-base-content/70 mt-5 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Bring it. Build it yourself, or build it with me — either way, the tools to run and grow it
        are right here.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
        <.link href={~p"/users/register"} class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Start free</.link>
        <a href={ExternalLinks.cal_john()} class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Build it with me</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layouts.marketing>
